Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 16:09:57 -0400
Subject: fetch: proxy tier - route flagged urls through FlareSolverr / renderd

Any url descriptor (url, dataUrl, api, trails) can declare via:
'flaresolverr' to be fetched through the local headless-chrome proxy -
executes page javascript and clears Cloudflare challenges. JSON bodies
rendered as chrome's JSON-viewer page are unwrapped transparently.
'renderd' (LIFTIE_RENDERD) reserved for a wait-for-selector renderer.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
